# Jwari Disruption: "Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}". Bot1 holds Island and Mox Sapphire up and pays its
# {1}{U} (a third source, Mox Jet, stays untapped, so the cost is exactly two). Bot2 taps its only Swamp for Duress and has
# nothing to pay with, so Duress is countered (CR 118.12) and Bot1's hand keeps its Lightning Bolt.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Jwari Disruption
Lightning Bolt
Island x2
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Duress
Swamp x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Hand.Jwari Disruption.Cast(Duress)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana = 
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Duress
Bot1.Graveyard = Jwari Disruption
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = true
